    "finalName": "",
    "description": "As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>, you can negate a single ranged attack by making a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check. The DC of the check is equal to the result of the attack roll you wish to negate, and you take a -5 cumulative penalty for every time you have used this Talent, <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Block\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Block\">Block</a></b>, <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deflect\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deflect\">Deflect</a></b>, or <b>Grenade Defense</b> since the beginning of your last turn.<br><br>You must have a blaster drawn in order to use this Talent, and you must be aware of the attack and not be <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flat-Footed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flat-Footed\">Flat-Footed</a>. Using this Talent consumes one shot from the blaster for each attack you negate.",
